    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic pa Jolevi ma Kohath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa kodi Aron, ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwan nyikway Kohath wok i dier nyikway Levi gi nonin pajo gi udi pa kwarere pajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cako oro piero adek tundo i oro piero abic. Jono je ma jonyalo timo tic ma makere kodi Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tic pa nyikway Kohath me i Wema ma romo mako kwoŋ gigipiny maleŋ loyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kambi oay, Aron gi wote jobino donjo to jolunyo nanga ma umo, to joumo Kakan ma Cikirok gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka jobino jengo i wiye pien mafoth ma umo, to joyaro i wiye nanga manyabululu iye je, aka jobino ketho gute mere i kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wiy meza ma mugat maleŋ m'imiyo Rwoth jolayaro nanga manyabululu, t'ijengo i wiye sendere mere, bakulere ri buban, siniya, kodi jagi ma mic ma math; mugat ma kisi ndelo bende labedo i wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jolayaro i wiy jo nanga m'obokere, to joumo gi pien mafoth, to joketho gute i kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino kwanyo nanga manyabululu, to joumo gine raŋaw tala ri lero, gi talin mere, kitambi mere, kabangala mere, kodi atewe ma mo mere ma jolaoro ma poko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino ketho gi gigipiny mere je i giumo ma pien mafoth, to joketho i miango ma tiŋo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wiy migam ma zahabu jolayaro nanga manyabululu, to joumo gi pien mafoth, aka jobino ketho gute mere i kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino kwanyo gigipiny ma tic je m'ioro i Kabedo Maleŋ, to joketho i nanga manyabululu, to joumo gi pien mafoth, to joketho jo i wiy miango ma tiŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino jowo woko buru wok i migam, to joyaro nanga ma rangi ariŋo i wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino ketho i wiye gigipiny ma migam je, m'ioro ma timo tic kenyo, kabangala, uma, kitiyin, kodi kalayere, gigipiny je ma migam; aka jolayaro i wiye giumo ma pien mafoth, to joketho gute mere i kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Aron kodi wote jotieko umo Kabedo Maleŋ kodi kombere mere, kareno kambi ay, rumacen nyikway Kohath jolabino to jotiŋo, to jokiripi geyo gigipiny maleŋ, kosa jonyalo tho. Me gigipiny ma Wema ma romo ma nyikway Kohath joripo tiŋo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliazar wod pa Aron jacway ri Were i wi migam labedo jakur ma mo ma lero, buban maŋwe kur, mic ma kodhi ma kisi hongo, gi mo ma wir, kuro tabenakulo parom gi gimoro je manitie i iye, i Wema kodi gigipiny mere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Rwoth luwo gi Musa kodi Aron, ka waco ni: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikiri wiŋadi woko nono madwoŋ ma nono pa Kohath wok i dier Jolevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me apaka wiripo tic gi jo ŋey jowokwo ma jok'otho ka jocore cegin gi gigipiny maleŋ loyo: Aron gi wote jobino donjo to jomiyo kisi ŋat'acel tic kosa bieto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Jolevi ma nono pa Kohath jokiripi donjo i iye ma mito neno gigipiny maleŋ kada nyak'adec; kosa jolatho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic pa Jolevi ma nono pa Gerison",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Rwoth oluwo gi Musa, ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwan nyikway Gerison bende, gi udi pa kwarere pajo kodi nonin pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cako i oro piero adek tundo oro piero abic ilakwano jo, joje ma jonyalo timo tic i Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a tic pa Jolevi ma Gerison, i timo tic kodi tiŋo gigipiny me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolatiŋo nanga ma umo tabenakulo, kodi Wema ma romo gi giumo mere, gi giumo ma woko ma pien mafoth manitie i wiye, kodi ndewiro ri dhiot ma Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka nanga ma umo kapido kodi ndewiro ma dhiot ma waŋkac ma kapido m'othoko tabenakulo kodi migam, gi thondhe kodi gigipiny ma tic pajo; aka jolatimo gimoro je ma ripo atima ma mako jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tic je mapa nyikway Gerison bino bedo paka Aron gi wote jowaci rijo, i kisi gimoro je ma jotiŋ, kodi i kisi gimoro je ma jotim; aka ibino miyo jo gimoro je ma jotiŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a tic pa nyikway Gerison ma mako kwoŋ Wema ma romo, aka Ithamar wod pa Aron ama laneno ni jotimo tic pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic pa Jolevi ma nono pa Merari",
          "type": "text"
